                                            "kind": "kit",
                                            "type": "image_text",
                                            "enabled": true,
                                            "settings": {
                                                "eyebrow": "1",
                                                "title": "Who we are",
                                                "body": "<p>This privacy policy applies to the mobile application <strong>Digital Teacher Notebook</strong> (“the App”), published by <strong>ITQAN Dev</strong> (“we”, “us”).</p><p>Contact for privacy requests: <strong>SUPPORT_EMAIL_HERE</strong><br/>(Optional WhatsApp support: <strong>SUPPORT_WHATSAPP_HERE</strong>)</p>",
                                                "image": null,
                                                "image_position": "right",
                                                "button_label": "",
                                                "button_url": "",
                                                "translations": {
                                                    "ar": {
                                                        "eyebrow": "1",
                                                        "title": "من نحن",
                                                        "body": "<p>تنطبق سياسة الخصوصية هذه على تطبيق <strong>دفتر المعلم الرقمي</strong> (“التطبيق”) الصادر عن <strong>ITQAN Dev</strong> (“نحن”).</p><p>للتواصل بخصوص الخصوصية: <strong>SUPPORT_EMAIL_HERE</strong><br/>(واتساب اختياري: <strong>SUPPORT_WHATSAPP_HERE</strong>)</p>"
                                                    }
                                                }
                                            }
                                        }
                                    ]
                                }
                            ]
