                                                "eyebrow": "4",
                                                "title": "What we do not do",
                                                "body": "<ul><li>No advertising SDKs / no ads in the App</li><li>No sale of personal data</li><li>No social login</li><li>No analytics SDK that tracks your students or payments to third-party ad networks</li><li>We do not upload your student lists, attendance, or payment amounts to ITQAN servers for marketing</li></ul>",
